==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Black Belt's Training}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card increases damage by 20 instead of 40.

===Origin===
*{{OBP|Red|game}} is a [[player character]] in [[Pokémon Red and Green Versions|Pokémon Red, Green]], [[Pokémon Blue Version (Japanese)|Blue]], and {{v2|Yellow}}, as well as their remakes {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}. The player character's house, as depicted in FireRed and LeafGreen, is featured in the regular print's illustration.

